    "basic": {
      "name": {
        "en": "Foxfire Orb",
        "th": "ลูกแก้วภูตไฟ"
      },
      "desc": {
        "en": "Mina deals Fire DMG by launching Foxfire Orbs at an enemy. On her final attack, she flourishes her tails to deal Fire DMG and gains a stack of Essence. / When Mina has 1 or more stacks of Essence, holding the Basic Attack button triggers Luminous Rush, dealing Fire DMG and consuming Essence. / When Luminous Rush triggers 3 times, using her Basic Attack again triggers its 4th Hit without consuming Essence.",
